<section>
    <h2>Q Format Paper System</h2>

    <p>unit.gl breakpoints are derived from the Q paper format system — a geometric series where each size is 1.5× the
        previous:</p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Physical foundation</strong> — Breakpoints map to real paper dimensions</li>
        <li><strong>4× multiplier</strong> — 1mm = 4px at 96dpi (standard screen density)</li>
        <li><strong>Density-aware</strong> — Scales correctly across device pixel ratios</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Portrait widths serve mobile devices, landscape widths serve desktop:</p>

    <table class="table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Breakpoint</th>
                <th>Q Format</th>
                <th>Width (mm)</th>
                <th>×4 = px</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>us</td>
                <td>Q07 Portrait</td>
                <td>60mm</td>
                <td>240px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ss</td>
                <td>Q06 Portrait</td>
                <td>90mm</td>
                <td>360px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>xs</td>
                <td>Q05 Portrait</td>
                <td>135mm</td>
                <td>540px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>sm</td>
                <td>Q04 Portrait</td>
                <td>180mm</td>
                <td>720px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>md</td>
                <td>Q03 Landscape</td>
                <td>360mm</td>
                <td>1440px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>lg</td>
                <td>Q02 Landscape</td>
                <td>540mm</td>
                <td>2160px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>xl</td>
                <td>Q01 Landscape</td>
                <td>720mm</td>
                <td>2880px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ul</td>
                <td>Q00 Landscape</td>
                <td>1080mm</td>
                <td>4320px</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</section>
